Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:04:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 16/97] diagnostics: env-gated per-second rate census (vblank,
 irq, VdSwap, present, guest clock)

WWE13_RATE_CENSUS=1 logs one [rate-census] line per wall second. Off by
default; when on, only atomic increments at the counted sites.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
